---
const { data, entry } = Astro.props as { data: any; entry: any };
const flagship = data.portfolio.flagship;
---
<header class="rn-hero">
  <div class="container rn-wrap">
    <a class="back" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}projects/reproductions/`}>← Quant Research Reproductions</a>
    <div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH REPRODUCTION · EXECUTION RESEARCH · PORTFOLIO CONSTRUCTION</div>
    <h1>股指期货滚贴水择时与市场情绪因子</h1>
    <p class="thesis"><strong>不预测指数方向</strong>，而是预测基差 <em>regime</em>，动态选择当月 / 当季合约，以提高股指期货 <strong>Roll Premium</strong>。</p>
    <p class="sub">从 Orient Futures 原研报出发，完成 Independent Reproduction、执行层优化，再把 Roll Timing 与 beta-neutral Cross-Maturity alpha 组合成研究型投资组合。</p>

    <div class="provenance-row" aria-label="Research provenance">
      <span>Orient Futures · 2026-06-26</span><span>Reproduced independently</span><span>Optimized and constructed by Lorien Lab</span>
    </div>

    <section class="flagship-performance" aria-labelledby="flagship-title">
      <div class="flagship-topline"><span id="flagship-title">{flagship.role}</span><span>FULL-SAMPLE RESEARCH RESULT · {data.cutoff}</span></div>
      <div class="flagship-grid">
        <div class="flagship-number-wrap">
          <div class="flagship-value">{flagship.annualizedReturn}</div>
          <div class="flagship-label">Annualized Return</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flagship-copy">
          <div class="flagship-risk">
            <div><span>Sharpe</span><strong>{flagship.sharpe}</strong></div>
            <div><span>Max Drawdown</span><strong>{flagship.maxDrawdown}</strong></div>
          </div>
          <h2>{flagship.name}</h2>
          <p>{flagship.note}</p>
          <small>{flagship.provenance}</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="strategy-stack-section" aria-labelledby="strategy-stack-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span id="strategy-stack-title">STRATEGY STACK</span><span>从核心策略到组合配置</span></div>
      <div class="strategy-stack">
        {data.portfolio.strategies.map((strategy: any) => <article class="strategy-card">
          <div class="strategy-role">{strategy.role}</div>
          <h3>{strategy.name}</h3>
          <div class="strategy-return">{strategy.annualizedReturn}</div>
          <div class="strategy-return-label">Annualized Return</div>
          <div class="strategy-risk">
            <div><span>Sharpe</span><strong>{strategy.sharpe}</strong></div>
            <div><span>Max DD</span><strong>{strategy.maxDrawdown}</strong></div>
          </div>
          <p>{strategy.note}</p>
        </article>)}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="evolution" aria-labelledby="evolution-title">
      <div class="section-head"><span id="evolution-title">From Paper to Portfolio</span><span>Strategy research → Portfolio construction</span></div>
      <div class="evolution-row">
        {data.evolution.map((step: any, i: number) => <>
          <article class:list={['evolution-step', step.kind === 'portfolio' && 'portfolio-step']}>
            <span>{step.label}</span><strong>{step.annualizedReturn}</strong><small>{i < 3 ? 'Annualized · roll research' : 'Annualized · portfolio'}</small>
          </article>
          {i < data.evolution.length - 1 && <div class="evolution-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>}
        </>)}
      </div>
      <div class="core-delta">
        <div><span>Optimized Roll vs Passive</span><strong>{data.hero.optimized.fullSampleImprovement}</strong></div>
        <div><span>OOS Improvement</span><strong>{data.hero.optimized.oosImprovement}</strong><small>{data.oosStart} → {data.cutoff}</small></div>
        <div><span>Switches / Year</span><strong>{data.hero.optimized.switchesPerYear}</strong><small>paper 4.5 · reproduced 4.6</small></div>
      </div>
      <p class="takeaway">Higher performance, without higher turnover. Portfolio-level uplift comes from combining a beta-bearing core strategy with a distinct spread-alpha stream.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="meta"><span>{entry.data.broker}</span><span>{entry.data.analysts.join(' · ')}</span><span>{entry.data.market}</span><span>{entry.data.frequency}</span></div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
.rn-hero{padding:54px 0 34px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 12%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 15%,transparent),transparent 31%),linear-gradient(180deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface) 74%,var(--bg)),var(--bg));border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.rn-wrap{max-width:1180px}.back{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:42px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:750}.eyebrow,.flagship-topline,.flagship-label,.flagship-risk,.strategy-role,.strategy-return-label,.strategy-risk,.section-head,.evolution-step,.core-delta,.meta{font-family:var(--font-mono)}.eyebrow{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent-strong);font-weight:800}.rn-hero h1{max-width:980px;margin:12px 0 18px;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.5rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.06em}.thesis{max-width:920px;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.16rem,2.1vw,1.65rem);line-height:1.55}.thesis em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent-strong)}.sub{max-width:900px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7}.provenance-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:28px 0 18px}.provenance-row span{padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem}
.flagship-performance{margin-top:18px;padding:24px 0 28px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.flagship-topline,.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.07em}.flagship-topline span:first-child{color:var(--accent-strong);font-weight:850}.flagship-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(360px,.92fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);gap:44px;align-items:end;margin-top:16px}.flagship-value{font:850 clamp(5.6rem,13vw,10rem)/.82 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:-.09em;color:var(--accent-strong)}.flagship-label{margin-top:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase}.flagship-risk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.flagship-risk span,.flagship-risk strong{display:block}.flagship-risk span{font-size:.58rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.flagship-risk strong{margin-top:3px;font-size:1.55rem;color:var(--ink)}.flagship-copy h2{margin:20px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.55rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em}.flagship-copy p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem}.flagship-copy small{display:block;margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font:600 .58rem var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase}
.strategy-stack-section{padding:24px 0 22px}.strategy-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}.strategy-card{min-width:0;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--surface) 88%,transparent)}.strategy-role{font-size:.61rem;color:var(--accent-strong);font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.07em}.strategy-card h3{margin:8px 0 18px;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.25}.strategy-return{font:820 clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.2rem)/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:-.055em}.strategy-return-label{margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.55rem;text-transform:uppercase}.strategy-risk{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.strategy-risk span,.strategy-risk strong{display:block}.strategy-risk span{font-size:.52rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.strategy-risk strong{margin-top:3px;font-size:.86rem}.strategy-card p{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.55}
.evolution{padding:22px 0 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.evolution-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:13px}.evolution-step{padding:14px 15px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px}.evolution-step span,.evolution-step strong,.evolution-step small{display:block}.evolution-step span{font-size:.58rem;color:var(--muted)}.evolution-step strong{margin-top:7px;font-size:1.35rem}.evolution-step small{margin-top:2px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.49rem}.portfolio-step{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 55%,var(--border));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent-soft) 28%,var(--surface))}.portfolio-step strong{color:var(--accent-strong)}.evolution-arrow{align-self:center;color:var(--muted);font:800 1rem var(--font-mono)}.core-delta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--border)}.core-delta>div{padding:11px 13px;background:var(--surface)}.core-delta span,.core-delta strong,.core-delta small{display:block}.core-delta span{font-size:.52rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}.core-delta strong{margin-top:3px;font-size:1rem;color:var(--accent-strong)}.core-delta small{margin-top:2px;font-size:.48rem;color:var(--muted)}.takeaway{margin:15px 0 0;font-weight:780;font-size:.9rem;max-width:920px}.meta{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.62rem}.meta span+span:before{content:'·';margin-right:18px;color:var(--border)}
@media(max-width:900px){.flagship-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.strategy-stack{grid-template-columns:1fr}.evolution-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.evolution-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}.core-delta{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:760px){.flagship-topline,.section-head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.rn-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,14vw,4.2rem)}.flagship-value{font-size:clamp(5rem,25vw,8rem)}.flagship-risk{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
</style>
